### ========================================
### MONITOR & LOGGING API TESTS
### Includes: Direct Monitor, Log Streaming
### Requires: Authentication + Tenant Context
### ========================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin@teknusantara.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

@token = {{login.response.body.data.access_token}}

### ========================================
### TRAFFIC MONITORING
### ========================================

### 1. STREAM TRAFFIC BY INTERFACE (WebSocket)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/internal/monitor/traffic/ether1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Upgrade: websocket

### Note: Will upgrade to WebSocket connection
### Real-time bandwidth monitoring untuk interface

### ========================================
### LOG STREAMING
### ========================================

### 2. STREAM MIKROTIK LOGS (WebSocket)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/internal/logs/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Upgrade: websocket

### Note: Real-time MikroTik log stream

### ========================================
### DIRECT MONITOR (Without Customer Entity)
### ========================================

### 3. STREAM TRAFFIC BY INTERFACE (Direct)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/internal/monitor/direct/traffic/ether1/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Upgrade: websocket

### 4. PING HOST (Direct)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/internal/monitor/direct/ping
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "host": "192.168.1.1",
  "count": 4
}

### Expected Response:
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "data": {
#     "host": "192.168.1.1",
#     "sent": 4,
#     "received": 4,
#     "packet_loss": 0,
#     "min_rtt": "1ms",
#     "avg_rtt": "3ms",
#     "max_rtt": "5ms"
#   }
# }

### 5. STREAM PING HOST (Direct - WebSocket)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/internal/monitor/direct/ping/192.168.1.1/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Upgrade: websocket

### ========================================
### ERROR CASES
### ========================================

### Ping invalid host (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/internal/monitor/direct/ping
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "host": "invalid-host",
  "count": 4
}

### Monitor non-existent interface (Should Handle Gracefully)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/internal/monitor/traffic/nonexistent
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
